# Unicode CLDR 47, locale ar, cldr-units-full/main/ar/units.json,
# duration-second: one "ثانية", few "ثوان", many/other "ثانية".
# The plural "ثواني" (with the final yaa written) is the unpausal spelling
# native text uses; en.wiktionary.org, ثانية, plural ثوان / ثواني.
# "ثانيه" is the same word with the taa marbuta written as a plain haa, the
# spelling untypeset Arabic keyboards produce -- unit_minute.voc ships the
# matching "دقيقه" for the same reason.
ثانية
ثانيه
ثوان
ثواني
